{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08769","headline":"效古二首 一 · 李白","name":"效古二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝入天苑中，谒帝蓬莱宫。\n青山映辇道，碧树摇苍空。\n谬题金闺籍，得与银台通。\n待诏奉明主，抽毫颂清风。\n归时落日晚，躞蹀浮云骢。\n人马本无意，飞驰自豪雄。\n入门紫鸳鸯，金井双梧桐。\n清歌弦古曲，美酒沽新丰。\n快意且爲乐，列筵坐羣公。\n光景不可留，生世如转蓬。\n早达胜晚遇，羞比垂钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}